# Data Access (Core)

- New **route handlers** use **direct Prisma** (`prisma` from `@/lib/db/prisma` or `@sokosumi/database/client`).
- Do **not** introduce new repository usage in routes.
- Legacy services may still call `@sokosumi/database/repositories`.

See [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) (Accessing Job-Related Resources).
